{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107866","id":2609990001,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bkUlx","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107866/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107866/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/718de59d2de6386e2491a84224cda5a352cf02eb","number":107866,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GLTF: MultiMeshInstance3D import","user":{"login":"2frac","id":5622249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjIyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5622249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac","html_url":"https://github.com/2frac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Allows to import MultiMeshInstance3D objects through EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing GLTF extension: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/blob/main/extensions/2.0/Vendor/EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing/README.md\r\n\r\nDepends on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107672 for blender. Will work by itself for pure GLTF files(if exporter option enabled)\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Depends on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108853 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109103.\r\n\r\nImplementation notes:\r\n\r\n- Adds 3 fields to GLTFNode - multimesh_translation, multimesh_rotation, multimesh_scale. All of this is referencing accessors indices in Gltf document.\r\n\r\n- Adds ImporterMeshInstance3D::multimesh. It is created and filled in GLTFDocument::_generate_mesh_instance - nearby ImporterMeshInstance3D creation. \r\n(I am not sure about that decision - almost every resource parsed/created separately from nodes(and assigned later), but instances info stored in node description and not in json's root, so maybe its ok)\r\n\r\n- Actual MultiMeshInstance3D creation happens in ResourceImporterScene::_pre_fix_node - nearby other nodes creation(and suffix parsing)\r\nCurrenly there is no condition to create MultiMeshInstance3D - it just checks whether it has or not valid multimesh. \r\nI think ideally there should be suffix condition, OR at least code should check other conditions first - like col/colonly - whatever might be more important to have.\r\n(for that reason MultiMeshInstance3D is not created early in GLTFDocument)(there is also some mesh material manipulation which duplication we might want to avoid)\r\nSuffixes might be tricky, however - blender will set name of instance node based on name of main node - not on the name of children node in editor.\r\n\r\n- to trigger multimesh creation, code need at least one of three accessors. Since blender creates all of them, i only tested that case.\r\n\r\n- On import there is some warnings like \"Instance count must be 0 to change the transform format\". I think it is related more to copying MultimeshInstance3D and/or scene creation, than to creation code itself. \r\n\r\n- There is also some work on GDScript properties and docs left(if rest is even desirable implementation)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-22T21:21:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T22:26:01Z","closed_at":"2025-11-19T21:44:51Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1028b8104f727ce59127fff2cd369e193500b935","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"2frac:gltf_import_multimesh","ref":"gltf_import_multimesh","repo":{"id":1004426261,"node_id":"R_kgDOO95UFQ","name":"godot","full_name":"2frac/godot","owner":{"login":"2frac","id":5622249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjIyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5622249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac","html_url":"https://github.com/2frac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/gists{/gist_id